  "_ambient_note": "Spines never list the tax_primary_blocklist feats (Power Attack, Dodge, Weapon Finesse, Combat Expertise, ...): those are house-waived AMBIENT -- every qualifying character has them, no pool can offer them, and the metric folds them via power_metric.ambient_feats. Listing one in a spine wastes the spine's top slot forever (the optimized_striker golden's predicate caught exactly that with Power Attack)."
